
# Longest Subarray Sum Divisible by K

## 1. Brute Force Solution

```python
class Solution:
    def longestSubarrayDivK(self, arr, k):
        n = len(arr)
        res = 0

        for i in range(n):
            for j in range(i, n):
                total = 0

                for p in range(i, j + 1):
                    total += arr[p]

                if total % k == 0:
                    res = max(res, j - i + 1)

        return res
```

**Time Complexity:** O(n³)  
**Space Complexity:** O(1)

