## 2. Better Solution (Your Approach)

```python
class Solution:
    def longestSubarrayDivK(self, arr, k):
        n = len(arr)
        res = 0

        for i in range(n):
            total = 0

            for j in range(i, n):
                total = (total + arr[j]) % k

                if total == 0:
                    res = max(res, j - i + 1)

        return res
```

**Time Complexity:** O(n²)  
**Space Complexity:** O(1)

